		{
			dependencies: ["074604E13C7DC3A2"]
			description: [
				"The &6Brass Tunnel&r is an upgraded version of the Andesite Tunnel. The Brass Tunnel has filter slots and some control options."
				""
				"Like the Andesite variant, if you place a belt connecting from its side, it will split items as well but you can use the filters slots to specify which item goes where. "
				""
